    "updated_at": "2025-05-08T10:24:06Z",
    "body": "You can check if you are online set a variable to false/true and if the network changes set it to true/false and add it to the condition for the progress bar animation.\nwe cannot change the behavior of the response of the api.\n   isOffline = false;\n   @HostListener('window:offline', ['$event'])\n  onoffline(event: any) {\n    this.isOffline = true;\n    console.log(event);\n  }\n  @HostListener('window:online', ['$event'])\n  ononline(event: any) {\n    this.isOffline = false;\n    console.log(event);\n  }  \n\nyou can use something like this if you are tying to animate the progress behavior.",
